moula ali ke gham me ye duniya hai sogwaar <br>
saare ghulaam kehte hai'n roro ke baar baar<br>
<br>
matam ke daagh seenou pe ankhou me ashk hai'n <br>
zehra ko pursa dene ko aaye hain azadaar<br>
<br>
kehta hai aasmaan bhi hyder huwe shaheed <br>
baitush-sharaf ka chhin gaya sabro suku'n qaraar<br>
<br>
aulaad saari kehti hai tanha huwe hai'n hum <br>
baba kise kahenge ham kisko karenge pyaar<br>
<br>
sar shaq hua hai jabse ali ka namaaz me <br>
hasnain sar ko peet ke rote hai zaar zaar<br>
<br>
<br>
baba ko apne khoon me ghaltaan dekh kar <br>
sehme khadi hai'n zainab-o-kulsoom dilfigaar<br>
<br>
kufe ke sab yateem ab phir se huwe yateem <br>
saare yateem rote hai'n kehte hai'n baar baar<br>
<br>
shaame gharibaa'n aaj hai kufe me momino <br>
moula tumhare gham me hai dawar bhi beqaraar<br>
